From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stanislaw Pal <kuncy7@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 09:53:52 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 090/192] 
 wifi-cfg80211-drop-noisy-key-addition-failed-message-during-FT

Imported from https://github.com/kuncy7/openwrt-nss-edma package/kernel/mac80211/patches/nss/subsys/350-wifi-cfg80211-drop-noisy-key-addition-failed-message-during-FT.patch (added in aaacdca9a1); the patch file carries no author or description.
[Andrei: Ported to 7.2: rdev_add_key() now takes the wdev.]
---
 net/wireless/nl80211.c | 7 ++-----
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/net/wireless/nl80211.c b/net/wireless/nl80211.c
index a067b25..c0213d8 100644
--- a/net/wireless/nl80211.c
+++ b/net/wireless/nl80211.c
@@ -5626,13 +5626,10 @@ static int nl80211_new_key(struct sk_buff *skb, struct genl_info *info)
 		err = nl80211_validate_key_link_id(info, wdev, link_id,
 				key.type == NL80211_KEYTYPE_PAIRWISE);
 
-	if (!err) {
-		err = rdev_add_key(rdev, wdev, link_id, key.idx,
+	if (!err)
+		return rdev_add_key(rdev, wdev, link_id, key.idx,
 				   key.type == NL80211_KEYTYPE_PAIRWISE,
 				    mac_addr, &key.p);
-		if (err)
-			GENL_SET_ERR_MSG(info, "key addition failed");
-	}
 
 	return err;
 }
